WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:08.600
Settings are in the Options menu. F10 opens them on MIDI, as in FL Studio.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.600
In FL's order: MIDI, Audio, General, Files, Theme, Project and Info.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.400
After a gap come LYNX's own: Ableton Link and the LYNX extras.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:26.200
Looking for one option? Press Ctrl+F and type, here metronome.

00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:32.000
It jumps to the first match and outlines it. Enter goes to the next one.

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:37.800
Tried something you don't like? Here a new theme, Ocean.

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:43.800
Reset this page puts the page back to its defaults, once you confirm.

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:49.600
For a few seconds, Undo brings your settings back.
